# erxes gateway (Apollo Router). No trailing slash.
#
# This is the only setting the portal needs. Everything else — its name, app
# token, knowledge base topic, ticket surfaces and appearance — comes from the
# help center whose website matches the address a request arrives on.
#
# Create one under Frontline → Help Center and set its Website to the address
# this portal is served from (for local work, http://localhost:3900).
#
# This file is for local development. A Docker image takes the same value as
# a build argument instead, because Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* into the client
# bundle at build time — see the Docker section of the README.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ERXES_API_URL=https://officenext.erxes.io/gateway
